{
  "title": "3. Longitudes : Meaning and Characteristics",
  "order": 35,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Longitudes are imaginary semicircles that run from the North Pole to the South Pole. They measure angular distance east or west of the Prime Meridian.",
      "id": "4gj4jjw"
    },
